1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:01,601
Add URL to Hotspot

2
00:00:01,601 --> 00:00:02,869
Select desired hotspot area

3
00:00:02,869 --> 00:00:04,137
Next, assign "URL" type to hotspot area

4
00:00:04,137 --> 00:00:06,239
Input Title

5
00:00:06,239 --> 00:00:08,742
Enter any URL website

6
00:00:08,742 --> 00:00:11,244
Choose to open URL in 'Same Window' or a 'New Tab'

7
00:00:11,244 --> 00:00:14,647
Click the "preview" button on the top right

8
00:00:14,647 --> 00:00:16,616
Preview CTA hotspot area to ensure it functions correctly

9
00:00:16,616 --> 00:00:19,552
Now you can access the website you entered

10
00:00:19,552 --> 00:00:20,754
Link to Vinmobi site

11
00:00:20,754 --> 00:00:22,188
Now try to click “Select URL from VinMobi”

12
00:00:22,188 --> 00:00:24,557
Choose a VinMobi Site and Confirm

13
00:00:24,557 --> 00:00:25,892
Click the "preview" button

14
00:00:25,892 --> 00:00:27,761
Open the Preview window

15
00:00:27,761 --> 00:00:29,262
Click hotspot area you created

16
00:00:29,262 --> 00:00:31,097
Now you can access the Vinmobi site you choose

17
00:00:31,097 --> 00:00:32,432
Link to VinDesk site

18
00:00:32,432 --> 00:00:35,268
Now try to click “Select URL from VinDesk”

19
00:00:35,268 --> 00:00:38,271
Choose a VinMobi Site and Confirm

20
00:00:38,271 --> 00:00:41,241
Click the "preview" button on the top right

21
00:00:41,241 --> 00:00:44,077
Now you can access the VinDesk site you choose

22
00:00:44,077 --> 00:00:45,478
That's it! You've successfully assigned a URL to your hotspot area.

23
00:00:45,478 --> 00:00:46,579
Explore more features and enhance your projects with VinCTA.
